{"v":1,"i":[[47.40011,8.33476,"wayside_cross","","","n5206621126"],[47.40148,8.30958,"wayside_cross","","","n5632952531"],[47.40189,8.381,"@a","Victoria 2000","","n14000538750"],[47.40276,8.39731,"@a","Frösche - Brückenhüter","","n14051441384"],[47.40285,8.36753,"monument","Bollenhof","","n820926054"],[47.40297,8.39768,"building","","Transformatorenstation Obere Reppischstrasse","w1544551951"],[47.40305,8.39702,"@a","Frösche - Brückenhüter","","n14051441383"],[47.40324,8.39703,"@a","Sumpfhühner - Pick und Nick","","n14051441379"],[47.40324,8.39705,"@a","Sumpfhühner - Pick und Nick","","n14051441377"],[47.4041,8.39963,"@a","","","n1920893283"],[47.40418,8.39957,"@a","Schnecken - Eile mit Weile","","n14051441381"],[47.40418,8.3996,"@a","Schnecken - Eile mit Weile","","n14051441376"],[47.40418,8.39962,"@a","Schnecken - Eile mit Weile","","n14051441380"],[47.40422,8.39476,"@a","Kakadujunge - Vögeliwohl","","n14051441385"],[47.40423,8.39479,"@a","Kakadujunge - Vögeliwohl","","n14051441386"],[47.40477,8.38115,"@a","Doppel-Flügelhund","","n8890053909"],[47.40477,8.38205,"@a","Vogeltor","Vogeltor","n1504338313"],[47.40482,8.38184,"@a","Hirschallee","","n2495361745"],[47.40499,8.38063,"@a","Stier auf Betonpodest","","n8889986479"],[47.40501,8.38141,"@a","Wiener Eule","Diese Skulptur ist das Original, welches als Vorlage f&uuml;r die Kopie der Eule in Wien diente. Letztere steht als Eckfigur an der Bibliothek der technischen Universit&auml;t am Karlsplatz. Mit 180 Tonnen ist es die gr&ouml;sste Skulptur von Bruno Weber.","n8936491981"],[47.40504,8.38146,"@a","Vogelterasse","","n8890044631"],[47.40505,8.38071,"@a","Uri-Stier","","n9995640725"],[47.40508,8.38158,"@a","Theaterplatz","Vier Doppeleulen markieren den Theaterplatz. Auch \n    auf diesem Platz fanden verschiedene Feste statt, die \n    Gotthard-Band drehte hier ihr Video.","n8936492519"],[47.40517,8.3808,"@a","Grosse Katze","","n9995592745"],[47.40518,8.38148,"@a","Skulpturengalerie im Freien","","n8890024468"],[47.40522,8.3806,"@a","Stierenpaar","Kuh und Stier symbolisieren wieder das Gleichgewicht\nder Geschlechter - eine bewohnbare Bauskulptur. Eine\nInnentreppe führt zum verglasten Kuppelraum, in dem\nsich ein Cheminee befindet - Lebensraum als Kunstwerk.\nHeute ist es das Mausoleum des Künstlers.","n9970095992"],[47.40522,8.38138,"@a","Tag- und Nachttor","Das Tor symbolisiert den Übergang vom Tag (Süden) und Nacht (Norden) - Zeichen der Polarität.  Das Tag- und Nacht-Tor ist Bruno Webers erste “Große-Skulptur” im Bruno Weber Park","n8880639221"],[47.40527,8.38055,"@a","Negativ-Schalungsformen","Bruno Weber schuf beinahe alle Skulpturen aus Lehm\nund in einer Holzschalung. Auf der Innenseite der\nHolzschalung wurde der Lehm für das Formen des\nNegativs der jeweiligen Skulptur aufgetragen. In den\nLeerraum der Lehm-Negativform wurde der Beton\ngegossen","n9970082451"],[47.40529,8.38126,"@a","Versammlung der Weisen","Funktionale Sitzskulpturen in Serie aufgereiht als Menschen oder Gegenstände, Stützwand, Sitzgelegenheit oder als Platzbegrenzung gegenüber dem Pavillon.","n8939582445"],[47.40536,8.38092,"@a","Drachentor","","n8939622612"],[47.40539,8.38044,"@a","Sitzungszimmer im Wald","Die Gesichter-Stuhl-Skulpturen versinnbildlichen\nSymbole:\nDer Knorrlige, der Pan (gr. Hirtengott), die Sonne, der\nGehässige, der Hitzige, der Mond und der Löwe.","n9970029431"],[47.40542,8.38105,"@a","Quellgöttin","Bruno Webers erste Aussenskulptur, der dort vorgefundenen Quelle gewidmet. Erste freistehende Aussenskulpturen entstanden ca. 6 Jahre nach den Säulen der Frontseite des Wohnhauses.","n8939627151"],[47.4055,8.39042,"@a","Eule - Hin und Zurück","","n14051441387"],[47.40553,8.38077,"@a","Blumenfrau mit Kind","","n9001976299"],[47.40563,8.38066,"@a","Vinci","","n9001976300"],[47.40566,8.38085,"@a","Delphinbrunnen","","n8944553054"],[47.40581,8.3802,"@a","Schönwetterpavillon","","n9001970919"],[47.40581,8.38054,"@a","Alpengeist","","n9001976298"],[47.40586,8.38,"@a","Fingerlöwen","Die Fingerlöwen weisen rechts nach Spreitenbach\nund links nach Dietikon. Bruno Weber war Bürger von\nDietikon und Menzingen.","n9970029430"],[47.4062,8.3797,"@a","Waldtor","Torskulpturen an der Waldgrenze mit Kopffüssler an\njedem Torpfosten. Ende des Rundgangs Richtung\nSpreitenbach. Der Bruno Weber Park befindet sich am\näussersten Ende von Spreitenbach, Aargau und bildet\ngewissermassen das Tor zu Zürich.","n9970065939"],[47.40681,8.34214,"wayside_cross","","","n6367867334"],[47.4071,8.38636,"@a","Seepferd - Im trauten Kreis","","n14051441388"],[47.40737,8.32596,"wayside_cross","","","n6367867338"],[47.40849,8.31603,"wayside_cross","","","n5186198987"],[47.40853,8.33109,"wayside_cross","","","n6367867330"],[47.40857,8.32727,"wayside_cross","","","n5206621125"],[47.40883,8.31793,"wayside_cross","","","n6367867335"],[47.40887,8.39635,"memorial","Bunker","","n7411566086"],[47.40958,8.39036,"wayside_cross","","","n5162708008"],[47.41172,8.32339,"wayside_cross","","","n6367867336"],[47.41287,8.34061,"wayside_cross","","","n3778036786"],[47.41313,8.3737,"@a","","","n9670378731"],[47.41519,8.34369,"wayside_cross","","","n3778036785"],[47.41594,8.36201,"wayside_shrine","","","n3346275257"],[47.41597,8.36227,"wayside_shrine","Mutter Gottes","","n3346275259"],[47.41598,8.37672,"wayside_cross","","","n10576886682","Q105998040"],[47.41599,8.36473,"@w","Abdankungshalle","","w310503805"],[47.41622,8.37139,"@a","","","n8808944606"],[47.41655,8.36692,"@a","","","n9670378730"],[47.41664,8.36635,"@w","Katholische Kirche","","w147397095","de:Neue katholische Kirche (Spreitenbach)"],[47.41667,8.30481,"memorial","Kessler Stein","","n10786872551"],[47.41704,8.36481,"@w","Reformierte Kirche","","w313728247","de:Alte paritätische Kirche (Spreitenbach)"],[47.41712,8.31673,"wayside_cross","","","n5191026074"],[47.41751,8.33733,"wayside_cross","","","n3778036787"],[47.4179,8.36508,"wayside_cross","","","n9921210571"],[47.419,8.3743,"@w","Königreichssaal Jehovas Zeugen","","n6564008525"],[47.41